WEBVTT

00:07:27.621 --> 00:07:30.496
until all our mothers
and children do well.

00:07:30.913 --> 00:07:34.996
I implore you to add your voices to ours.

00:07:35.038 --> 00:07:37.996
To amplify this message loud and clear.

00:07:38.454 --> 00:07:42.079
That maternal and child health
is a human right.

00:07:42.079 --> 00:07:43.246
Thank you.